cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Nevada Data Center Tax Abatement Tracker
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it and link the underlying primary sources.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Doubin
    given-names: Max
repository-code: https://github.com/MaxDoubin/nv-datacenter-tracker
abstract: >-
  An open, fully sourced dataset of tax abatements approved under Nevada Revised Statutes 360.754, the
  data center abatement program created by S.B. 170 (2015). Records what each award promised in jobs,
  wages and capital investment, what it cost in forgone sales-and-use and personal property tax, and what
  the public record does and does not show about delivery. Includes a ledger of documented conflicts
  between official state sources.
keywords:
  - Nevada
  - data centers
  - tax abatements
  - tax expenditures
  - government transparency
  - open data
  - NRS 360.754
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-24"
